  "instance_name": "donald_trump_border_wall_proposal",
  "label": "Donald Trump's Proposed Border Wall",
  "description": "A policy proposal by Donald Trump, then a presidential candidate and later the 45th President of the United States, to build a physical barrier along the U.S.-Mexico border. The proposal was part of his broader immigration platform and was widely criticized for its cost, feasibility, and perceived racial undertones. The meme uses this proposal as a rhetorical device to suggest that such a wall was 'obvious' or 'necessary' in light of the Paris attack, implying a connection between immigration and terrorism.",
